<section aria-label="Our services" class="wix-section home-services-shell"><div class="section-inner"><div class="home-hero-grid"><div class="hero-left-col"><div class="hero-card tall"><img alt="Jeweller holding a custom ring design sketch" height="500" loading="eager" src="{{ 'cameron-co-jewellery-remodelling-bento.webp' | asset_url }}" width="1080"/><h2 class="hero-card-label">Jewellery Remodelling</h2></div><div class="hero-card"><img alt="Jewellery repair components and settings" height="500" loading="eager" src="{{ 'cameron-co-jewellery-repair-components-bento.webp' | asset_url }}" width="1080"/><h2 class="hero-card-label">Repairs</h2></div></div><div class="hero-right-col"><div class="hero-card"><img alt="Loose green sapphire gemstones" height="500" loading="eager" src="{{ 'cameron-co-loose-green-sapphire-gemstones-bento.webp' | asset_url }}" width="1080"/><h2 class="hero-card-label">Appraisals</h2></div><div class="hero-card tall"><img alt="Teal sapphire and diamond halo rings" height="500" loading="eager" src="{{ 'cameron-co-teal-sapphire-diamond-halo-rings-bento.webp' | asset_url }}" width="1080"/><h2 class="hero-card-label">Jewellery Replacement</h2></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="insurance-section wix-section"><div class="section-inner insurance-inner"><h2 class="section-title insurance-title">Insurance Specialists</h2><h3 class="section-subtitle insurance-subtitle">We help you replace your lost, damaged or stolen jewellery</h3><p class="insurance-copy insurance-copy-primary">Working closely with Australia's major insurance companies and loss adjusting firms, Cameron &amp; Co will help you with your lost, damaged or stolen jewellery. For over 25 years, Cameron &amp; Co has worked specifically to assist people with their insurance claims, providing current appraisals of items as well as replacement pieces. Cameron &amp; Co has a proven and trusted reputation with your insurance company for industry knowledge, extensive range of product, design/manufacture and service levels.</p><p class="insurance-copy insurance-copy-secondary">For your convenience, we open by appointment Monday to Friday with extended hours should that help with your busy schedule.</p><div class="btn-row-center"><a class="home-button home-button-red" href="{{ pages['booking'].url }}">Book an appointment</a></div></div></section>
<section aria-labelledby="services-heading" class="wix-section what-we-do-section"><div class="section-inner"><h2 class="section-title" id="services-heading">What We Can Do For You</h2><div class="service-list"><article class="service-item"><img alt="" aria-hidden="true" height="34" loading="lazy" src="{{ 'cameron-co-diamond-icon-small.webp' | asset_url }}" width="34"/><h3>Appraisals</h3><p>Depending on information available, your location, schedule and personal preference, the appraisal process is conducted either by phone, at our showroom or at your home or workplace. For your convenience, we open by appointment Monday to Friday with extended hours should that help with your busy schedule.</p></article><article class="service-item"><img alt="" aria-hidden="true" height="34" loading="lazy" src="{{ 'cameron-co-diamond-icon-small.webp' | asset_url }}" width="34"/><h3>Jewellery Remodelling</h3><p>We can remake your old jewellery into new designs. Our jewellers take apart the original piece and reuse the gems and metals. We then craft a custom, updated jewellery item based on your style.</p></article><article class="service-item"><img alt="" aria-hidden="true" height="34" loading="lazy" src="{{ 'cameron-co-diamond-icon-small.webp' | asset_url }}" width="34"/><h3>Repairs</h3><p>People are advised to get their jewellery checked on a regular basis for wear and tear. A few minor repairs will save you from a loss of your precious stones. At Cameron &amp; Co we offer a complimentary ring clean and will also examine your jewellery for wear and tear. We offer an array of repair services for your jewellery items.</p></article><article class="service-item"><img alt="" aria-hidden="true" height="34" loading="lazy" src="{{ 'cameron-co-diamond-icon-small.webp' | asset_url }}" width="34"/><h3>Jewellery Replacements</h3><p>Once your items have been assessed, a replacement value will be established by your insurance company. You may choose to replace with similar or alternative items and are able to replace with items from stock, special order or individually designed and handcrafted in our workshop.</p></article></div><div class="btn-row-center home-chat-button-row"><a class="home-button home-button-dark" href="{{ pages['contact'].url }}">Chat to us</a></div></div><img alt="Stack of gold and silver bezel-set gemstone rings" class="what-we-do-rings" height="369" loading="lazy" src="{{ 'cameron-co-coloured-gemstone-bezel-rings.webp' | asset_url }}" width="236"/></section>
<section aria-label="Partner brands" class="logos-strip"><h2 class="section-title brands-title">Our Brands</h2><div class="logos-track-wrap"><div aria-hidden="true" class="logos-track"><img alt="Ikecho Pearls" class="logo-img-item" src="{{ 'ikecho-pearls-jewellery-logo.webp' | asset_url }}"/><img alt="Ice Watch" class="logo-img-item" src="{{ 'ice-watch-brand-logo.webp' | asset_url }}"/><img alt="Citizen Watches" class="logo-img-item" src="{{ 'citizen-watches-logo.webp' | asset_url }}"/><img alt="Classique Jewellery" class="logo-img-item" src="{{ 'classique-jewellery-logo.webp' | asset_url }}"/><img alt="Burberry" class="logo-img-item" src="{{ 'burberry-brand-logo.webp' | asset_url }}"/><img alt="Fossil" class="logo-img-item" src="{{ 'fossil-brand-logo.webp' | asset_url }}"/><img alt="Dora International" class="logo-img-item" src="{{ 'dora-international-jewellery-logo.webp' | asset_url }}"/><img alt="Georgini Jewellery" class="logo-img-item" src="{{ 'georgini-jewellery-logo.webp' | asset_url }}"/><img alt="Thomas Sabo" class="logo-img-item" src="{{ 'thomas-sabo-brand-logo.webp' | asset_url }}"/><img alt="Peter W Beck" class="logo-img-item" src="{{ 'peter-w-beck-jewellery-logo.webp' | asset_url }}"/><img alt="Ikecho Pearls" class="logo-img-item" src="{{ 'ikecho-pearls-jewellery-logo.webp' | asset_url }}"/><img alt="Ice Watch" class="logo-img-item" src="{{ 'ice-watch-brand-logo.webp' | asset_url }}"/><img alt="Citizen Watches" class="logo-img-item" src="{{ 'citizen-watches-logo.webp' | asset_url }}"/><img alt="Classique Jewellery" class="logo-img-item" src="{{ 'classique-jewellery-logo.webp' | asset_url }}"/><img alt="Burberry" class="logo-img-item" src="{{ 'burberry-brand-logo.webp' | asset_url }}"/><img alt="Fossil" class="logo-img-item" src="{{ 'fossil-brand-logo.webp' | asset_url }}"/></div></div></section>
<section aria-labelledby="testimonials-heading" class="home-testimonials-preview wix-section"><div class="section-inner"><h2 class="section-title" id="testimonials-heading">What Others Have to Say</h2><div class="home-testimonials-list"><article class="home-testimonial-card"><img alt="" aria-hidden="true" class="testimonial-diamond" src="{{ 'cameron-co-diamond-icon-small.webp' | asset_url }}"/><h3>Roslyn</h3><p>Many thanks for your excellent service in providing a replacement diamond for my Insurance Claim. I am thrilled with the result and will recommend your service to others if the occasion arises.</p></article><article class="home-testimonial-card"><img alt="" aria-hidden="true" class="testimonial-diamond" src="{{ 'cameron-co-diamond-icon-small.webp' | asset_url }}"/><h3>Marina</h3><p>Just confirming that I received rings today. They are absolutely gorgeous. Many thanks for your patience, kind attention to detail and for making a terrible situation, under the circumstances, very special.</p></article><article class="home-testimonial-card"><img alt="" aria-hidden="true" class="testimonial-diamond" src="{{ 'cameron-co-diamond-icon-small.webp' | asset_url }}"/><h3>Cate</h3><p>Tracey, April and the team did a fantastic job replacing my wedding ring. From sourcing an outstanding stone, developing the design, to crafting the final piece, I always felt like I was in the best hands possible.</p></article></div><div class="btn-row-center home-testimonials-button-row"><a class="home-button home-button-dark" href="{{ pages['testimonials'].url }}">Read more</a></div></div></section>
